  "title": {
    "zh": "两块刚好够",
    "en": "The Exact Pair"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "配对破局 · 同分选序 · 只够取两块",
    "en": "Target sum · Tie-break order · Budget for two"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "充电柜有六块电池。扫描里的 charges 对应上排从左到右的电量。只取两块，使电量之和正好等于 target。如果有多对，选左边那块位置最靠左的一对，仍打平就选另一块更靠左的。按从左到右的顺序提交两个从 0 开始的位置，位置须来自同一列表，再停在出口。移动与拾取各耗 1 回合，限 13 回合。",
    "en": "There are six packs in the cabinet. The charges scan list is their readings from left to right along the top row. Retrieve exactly two that add up to target. If several pairs qualify, favor the earliest left pack, then the earliest right pack. Submit the two zero-based indices in left-to-right order from the same list and stop at the exit. Each move or pickup costs one turn, with 13 turns total."
  },
